    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DRONE LORD</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>Virtual Reality First Person Shooter</strong> that will keep you on the edge of your seat dodging energy beams, bullets and canon fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast your way</strong> through many types of enemy drones on increasingly difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on which level you will have a range of weapons: <strong>Machine guns, Rocket launchers, Flame Lasers, Shotguns, Poison Sprays (for organic drones), Crossbows (for ancient times) and more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all this set to a &quot;kick ass&quot; soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are shielded by an <strong>armored levitation suit</strong> that can take 1 or 2 enemy strikes, <strong>but 3 strikes and you're out</strong>. That means back to the start of the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all weapons will defeat all drones. You'll need to experiment with different combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success on a level lets you enter the time / space portal to transport you to the next level. Be prepared for a number of surprises the Drone Lord has cooked up for you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Luck Hotshot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: <strong>&quot;FORTUNE FAVORS THE BOLD&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE DRONE LORD</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>Virtual Reality First Person Shooter</strong> that will keep you on the edge of your seat dodging energy beams, bullets and canon fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast your way</strong> through many types of enemy drones on increasingly difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on which level you will have a range of weapons: <strong>Machine guns, Rocket launchers, Flame Lasers, Shotguns, Poison Sprays (for organic drones), Crossbows (for ancient times) and more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all this set to a &quot;kick ass&quot; soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are shielded by an <strong>armored levitation suit</strong> that can take 1 or 2 enemy strikes, <strong>but 3 strikes and you're out</strong>. That means back to the start of the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all weapons will defeat all drones. You'll need to experiment with different combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success on a level lets you enter the time / space portal to transport you to the next level. Be prepared for a number of surprises the Drone Lord has cooked up for you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Luck Hotshot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: <strong>&quot;FORTUNE FAVORS THE BOLD&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
